*.swp
*~

# --- Build artifacts. Packaged skills are build outputs, so attach them to GitHub Releases ---
*.skill
dist/
build/

# --- NEVER commit a live memory or workspace home into this repo ---
# This repo ships only the empty seeds under memory/ and workspace-seed/. A live memory
# home holds personal positions, decisions and confidential sections, and a live workspace
# home holds working documents and licensed reference material (tenet T3). Wherever the
# homes live, they sit outside this repo. The patterns below catch one dropped into it.
# skills/parvis-owner/SKILL.md here ships filled in with the maintainer's profile, and
# your own filled-in copy stays at ~/.claude/skills/parvis-owner/, out of any public fork.
/parvis-memory/
/parvis-workspace/
*.local.md
